+self.reward_cfg["dist_weight"] = 0.1
+```
+
+Compute `truncated` before reward calculation, define:
+
+```python
+timed_out = bool(truncated and not success and not collided)
+```
+
+Append `q_target - q` after `q` and `qd` in `_get_obs`, using zeros only before `q_target` exists.
+
+- [x] **Step 4: Run `tests.test_rm75_env` and confirm all environment tests pass.**
+
+Run:
+
+```bash
+RM75_DEBUG=0 .venv/bin/python -m unittest tests.test_rm75_env -v
